<p>In an extreme feat of agility, you move to a spot you can see within range, bounding around, over, or through any enemies in the way.</p><p>This talent cannot be used while wearing heavy armor, and leaves you exhausted.  The exhaustion increases the cost of your activated Mobility talents by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">81%, 64%, 55%, 48%, 44%</acronym> (stacking), but fades over <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">27, 23, 20, 19, 17</acronym> turns.</p>